/E (It started during the train ride, when we slowly gained elevation as we went through a stunning mountain pass. We were constantly looking to spot the Matterhorn as we got closer to our destination. Once we reached Zermatt, I was quickly charmed by the cute car-less town. The Matterhorn thwarted us as it was blanketed in clouds. Nonetheless, we had a great afternoon visiting the gear and chocolate stores.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
