106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 64 0 R
/T (It was absolutely magical to get our first view of the Matterhorn! It felt like every time we stopped the view kept getting better and better. Soon, we reached the golden larches! The larches were the most unexpected but pleasant surprise - I had always wanted to see them in nature and had not realized they would be in Switzerland! And to make things even more picturesque there was a bit of snow throughout the hike!  Our last day in Zermatt was just as lovely, we ate delicious food and enjoyed another day hiking.  Zermatt was a highlight of my time living in Switzerland. I am really happy we chose to visit in the fall, it was even better than I could have expected.)
/E (It was absolutely magical to get our first view of the Matterhorn! It felt like every time we stopped the view kept getting better and better. Soon, we reached the golden larches! The larches were the most unexpected but pleasant surprise - I had always wanted to see them in nature and had not realized they would be in Switzerland! And to make things even more picturesque there was a bit of snow throughout the hike!  Our last day in Zermatt was just as lovely, we ate delicious food and enjoyed another day hiking.  Zermatt was a highlight of my time living in Switzerland. I am really happy we chose to visit in the fall, it was even better than I could have expected.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
