/T (We were spoiled with amazing French pastries and viennoiseries to fuel our adventures. Across the street from our AirBnB was the bakery "Chalet 4810". Felix had the best croissant of his life at this bakery! And only for 2.50 euros! Coming from Switzerland, we could not believe we could get such good food for so cheap - it was an entirely different level.)
